WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.602
-Today, usually, you know,
at the end of the week

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.104
that's when I catch up
with some personal stuff

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:07.540
I check my inbox, return some
e-mails and of course I send out

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.475
my thank you notes,
and I was running --

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:11.310
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.645
I was running
a bit behind today,

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.179
so I thought, if you guys
wouldn't mind,

00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:15.982
I'd just like to write out my
weekly thank you notes

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:17.750
right now, during the show,
is that okay with you?

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.520
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.754
What's that?
-During the show?

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:23.289
-What's that?
-You don't have any time other?

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:26.326
-This is the only time I got.
The audience says it's cool.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:28.794
And so you're the only one
-Seems like your time management

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:30.630
is very poor.
-Well, you know I was --

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.465
-Every week you just seem to not
be able --

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.400
-Well, every week, I try to
write these out

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.035
but things happen and I,
you know.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:38.304
-Right.
-Today I was just so busy.

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:42.575
-What were you doing?
-I got a lower back tattoo.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:45.011
[ Laughter ]
I just wish the Budweiser frog

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:47.113
hung in there longer.
-oh, yeah.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.982
[ Laughter ]
-James, can I get some

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:50.516
thank you note writing music
please?

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:52.452
Oh, wow.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:55.654 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:58.691
-Yeah, there you go.
[ Clears throat ]

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:01.994
-Wow.
-Put you in the mood for laughs.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:05.464
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:08.534
-Thank you, "Matrix:
Resurrections'" trailer,

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:11.437
for reminding me how weird
things get if you take

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:13.706
DayQuil and NyQuil
at the same time.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.175
It's a, it's a mind --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:18.278
-Gotta even yourself out.

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:25.651
-Thank you,
start of the NFL season,

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:28.287
for giving Americans a new
reason to be mad at people

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:29.855
from others states.

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:32.826
[ Cheers and applause ]
[ Imitates yelling ]

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:41.301
Thank you, September,
for being the one month

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:44.203
fantasy football is fun before
all of your friends start to

00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:46.138
make it way too serious.

00:01:46.138 --> 00:01:48.174
[ Laughter ]
We said no trades!

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:52.812
We said no trades
after 10:00 p.m.

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:55.648
It's fantasy football, okay?

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:01.488
Thank you,
first day of school photos,

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:04.857
for giving every kid a chance to
take their very own mug shot.

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:09.829
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:17.036
I feel it's faster,
I thought it would be faster

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:19.538
to just lick it and just not
stick it in the envelope.

00:02:19.538 --> 00:02:21.607
-Right.
-But still mail it.

00:02:21.607 --> 00:02:23.209
-Yeah, you're still gonna mail
it, to I don't know who,

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.843
but you're gonna mail it.
-Yeah.

00:02:24.843 --> 00:02:27.313
Ted, they get them.
School photos still gets

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.015
the thank you note.
-Yeah.

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:30.984
School photo, yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:37.089
Thank you, everything bagels,
for looking like

00:02:37.089 --> 00:02:40.126
a glazed donut hooked up
with a bird feeder.

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:45.064
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:46.766
That's my favorite bagel.
-Everything bagel?

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:49.334
-An everything bagel.
I do everything bagel --

00:02:49.334 --> 00:02:51.237
-Right.
-Raw.

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:54.240
-Not toasted.
-Not toasted, no.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.375
-Who would toast my bagel.
-Toast my bagel?

00:02:56.375 --> 00:03:00.212
No toasting, raw, sushi-fied.
-Right.

00:03:00.212 --> 00:03:04.250
-Raw, sushi bagel, with veggie
cream cheese.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.552
-Veggie cream cheese?
That's good.

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.153
-That's where you get healthy.
-Yeah.

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:11.157
-You ever have a flagel?
-What's a flagel?

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:12.792
-Apparently,
was talking to Ed Platt,

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:15.027
