he says the flagel,

00:03:15.027 --> 00:03:17.163
which I've had before,
it's a flattened bagel.

00:03:17.163 --> 00:03:19.866
-Oh, I always called that
a bialy.

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:23.435
-You're right, I'm wrong.
-Oh.

00:03:23.435 --> 00:03:27.406
-Maybe you should host the show.
I'm a fool, I'm a fool.

00:03:27.406 --> 00:03:29.108
-I'm just a dummy.
-Ladies and gentlemen,

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:31.677
I guess I'm a fool, I hope my
mother and father are watching.

00:03:31.677 --> 00:03:34.747
[ Cheers and applause ]
I'm an idiot, I got you.

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:36.782
You're right, you're right.
-Oh, please.

00:03:36.782 --> 00:03:38.184
-No, I appreciate you.

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:39.418
I appreciate you bringing me
down.

00:03:39.418 --> 00:03:41.454
-Thanks for correcting me.
-My wife and kids

00:03:41.454 --> 00:03:43.222
