-Thank you very much.

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:40.179
-Cool.
-Tareek, I rest my case.

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:43.148
-Guys, does a flagel exist?
[ Audience "Yes" ]

00:04:43.148 --> 00:04:45.784
Dope. Okay.
-Dope?

00:04:45.784 --> 00:04:46.986
-Jury has spoken.
-That's, just --?

00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:48.254
-Dome?
-Dope.

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:51.624
-Oh, dope.
-My work here is done.

00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:56.295
-Thank you, guitar capos, for
